function percentile(value, all=offers) { const sorted=[...all].sort((a,b)=>a.cutoff-b.cutoff); const rank=sorted.filter(x=>x.cutoff<=value).length; return Math.round(((rank-0.5)/sorted.length)*100); }
const slugify = value => value.toLowerCase().normalize('NFD').replace(/[\u0300-\u036f]/g,'').replace(/[^a-z0-9]+/g,'-').replace(/(^-|-$)/g,'');
function downloadCsv(rows){const headers=['id','universidad','sigla','titulacion','campus','ciudad','rama','nota_corte','escala','curso','referencia_laboral','afiliacion_4_anos','indefinido_4_anos','grupo_universitario_4_anos','base_cotizacion_4_anos','fuente'];const escape=value=>`"${String(value??'').replaceAll('"','""')}"`;const lines=[headers.join(';'),...rows.map(o=>{const employment=employmentForOffer(o);return [o.id,o.university,o.short,o.degree,o.campus,o.city,o.branch,o.cutoff,14,'2025-2026',employment?.label,employment?.affiliation4,employment?.indefinite4,employment?.universityGroup4,employment?.contributionBase4,o.source].map(escape).join(';')})];const blob=new Blob(['\uFEFF'+lines.join('\n')],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'});const url=URL.createObjectURL(blob);const link=document.createElement('a');link.href=url;link.download='atlas-madrid-ofertas.csv';link.click();URL.revokeObjectURL(url)}
function parseRoute(pathname=window.location.pathname){const parts=pathname.split('/').filter(Boolean);if(parts[0]==='oferta')return {type:'offer',value:parts[1]};if(parts[0]==='universidad')return {type:'university',value:parts[1]};if(parts[0]==='grado')return {type:'degree',value:parts.slice(1).join('-')};if(parts[0]==='ciudad')return {type:'city',value:parts.slice(1).join('-')};if(parts[0]==='espana')return {type:'national'};if(parts[0]==='comparar-universidades')return {type:'universityCompare'};return {type:'home'};}
const ructToShort={ '010':'UCM', '023':'UAM', '025':'UPM', '029':'UAH', '036':'UC3M', '056':'URJC' };
function findOfferByRoute(list, value){const exact=list.find(o=>o.id===value);if(exact)return exact;const match=String(value||'').match(/^madrid-([^-]+)-(.+)$/);if(!match)return null;const short=ructToShort[match[1]]||match[1];return list.find(o=>o.short===short&&String(o.id).endsWith(`-${match[2]}`))||null;}
function OutcomePanel({offer}){const metrics=universityOutcomeMetrics[offer.short]||{};const employment=employmentForOffer(offer);const value=(number,suffix='%')=>number==null?'No disponible':`${number.toFixed(2).replace('.',',')}${suffix}`;return <section className="outcomes-section"><div className="outcomes-head"><div><div className="eyebrow">RESULTADOS Y CONTEXTO</div><h2>Datos útiles para decidir</h2><p>Las métricas académicas disponibles proceden del SIIU. Cuando aún no existe el cruce por titulación, mostramos el agregado de la universidad y lo marcamos como contexto.</p></div></div><div className="outcomes-grid"><div className="outcome-card"><span>Tasa de rendimiento</span><strong>{value(metrics.performance)}</strong><small>Universidad · todos los ámbitos · 2022–23</small></div><div className="outcome-card"><span>Abandono durante el 1.º año</span><strong>{value(metrics.dropout)}</strong><small>Universidad · todos los ámbitos · 2019–20</small></div><div className="outcome-card"><span>Graduación en 4 años</span><strong>{value(metrics.graduation)}</strong><small>Universidad · todos los ámbitos · 2017–18</small></div><div className={employment?'outcome-card':'outcome-card pending'}><span>Base de cotización · 4 años</span><strong>{employment?fmtEuro(employment.contributionBase4):'No disponible'}</strong><small>{employment?employment.granularity+' · '+employment.cohort:'No hay cruce laboral compatible para esta oferta.'}</small></div><div className={tuitionForOffer(offer)?'outcome-card':'outcome-card pending'}><span>Coste orientativo · 60 ECTS</span><strong>{tuitionForOffer(offer)?fmtEuro(tuitionForOffer(offer).annual):'No disponible'}</strong><small>{tuitionForOffer(offer)?'Nivel '+tuitionForOffer(offer).level+' · primera matrícula · '+tuitionForOffer(offer).academicYear:'No hay clasificación de experimentalidad compatible.'}</small></div><div className={metrics.admissionMean==null?'outcome-card pending':'outcome-card' }><span>Nota media de admisión · nuevo ingreso</span><strong>{metrics.admissionMean==null?'No disponible':`${metrics.admissionMean.toFixed(2).replace('.',',')}`}</strong><small>Universidad · 2022–23 · no es la nota media del expediente ni de esta carrera</small></div><div className="outcome-card"><span>Nuevo ingreso</span><strong>{metrics.newAdmissionCount==null?"No disponible":metrics.newAdmissionCount}</strong><small>Universidad 2022-23 · todos los ambitos</small></div><div className="outcome-card"><span>Matriculados en grado presencial</span><strong>{universityEnrolmentMetrics[offer.short]==null?"No disponible":universityEnrolmentMetrics[offer.short].toLocaleString('es-ES')}</strong><small>Universidad · 2023–24 · no es esta titulación</small></div><div className="outcome-card"><span>Egresados de grado presencial</span><strong>{universityGraduateMetrics[offer.short]==null?"No disponible":universityGraduateMetrics[offer.short].toLocaleString('es-ES')}</strong><small>Universidad · 2023–24 · no es una tasa</small></div></div>{employment&&<div className="employment-context"><div><span>Afiliación</span><strong>{value(employment.affiliation4)}</strong></div><div><span>Contrato indefinido</span><strong>{value(employment.indefinite4)}</strong></div><div><span>Grupo universitario</span><strong>{value(employment.universityGroup4)}</strong></div><p>Referencia agregada del ámbito de {employment.label}; no es un resultado garantizado para esta oferta.</p></div>}{employment&&<div className="employment-timeline"><div><span>Evolución laboral nacional</span><small>Todos los ámbitos · cohorte 2018–19 · contexto, no esta carrera</small></div><div className="timeline-grid">{employmentSeries.years_after_graduation.map((years,index)=><div key={years}><b>{years} {years===1?'año':'años'}</b><span>{fmtPercent(employmentSeries.affiliation.total[index])} afiliación</span><span>{fmtEuro(employmentSeries.contribution_base.total[index])} BMC</span></div>)}</div><p>La evolución de 1 a 4 años es nacional y agregada; la tarjeta anterior conserva el dato específico del campo cuando existe.</p></div>}<div className="outcomes-note"><Info size={15}/><span>Estos porcentajes describen el contexto de {offer.university}, no el resultado garantizado de esta oferta. La tasa de rendimiento es créditos superados entre créditos matriculados; el abandono y la graduación tienen definiciones y cohortes propias.</span></div><div className="outcomes-sources">Fuentes SIIU: <a href={outcomeSources.performance} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">rendimiento</a><a href={outcomeSources.dropout} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">abandono</a><a href={outcomeSources.graduation} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">graduación</a><a href={outcomeSources.admissionMean} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">nota media de admisión</a><a href={outcomeSources.newAdmissionCount} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">nuevo ingreso</a><a href={enrolmentSource} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">matriculados</a><a href={graduatesSource} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">egresados</a><a href={outcomeSources.employment} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">inserción laboral</a>{employment&&<><a href={employment.sourceUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">referencia de ámbito</a><a href={employment.officialDatasetUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">tabla oficial</a></>}</div></section>}
function ScoreFinder({score,setScore,filtered}){const numeric=Number(score.replace(',','.'));return <section className="score-section"><div><div className="eyebrow">TU NOTA EN ESPAÑA</div><h2>¿Qué puedes estudiar?</h2><p>Introduce una nota para situarla frente a las ofertas y aplicar los filtros.</p></div><div className="score-input"><input inputMode="decimal" value={score} onChange={e=>setScore(e.target.value)} placeholder="12,40" aria-label="Tu nota de admisión"/><span>/ 14</span>{score&&Number.isFinite(numeric)&&<div className="score-result"><strong>{Math.max(0,Math.min(100,percentile(numeric)))}<small>º percentil</small></strong><span>entre las ofertas comparables<br/><b>{filtered.filter(o=>o.cutoff<=numeric).length} opciones</b> por debajo de tu nota</span></div>}</div></section>}
function RouteLoading({label='Cargando vista…'}){return <div className="route-loading" role="status" aria-live="polite">{label}</div>}
function NationalMap({rows}){const coordinates={"Campus de Ourense":[42.336,-7.864],"Campus de Pontevedra":[42.431,-8.644],"Campus de Vigo":[42.240,-8.720],"Campus de Santiago":[42.878,-8.544],"Campus de Lugo":[43.012,-7.556],"Campus da Coruña":[43.362,-8.411],"Campus de Ferrol":[43.489,-8.219],Zaragoza:[41.649,-0.889],Huesca:[42.136,-0.408],Teruel:[40.345,-1.106],"La Almunia":[41.476,-1.375]};const points=[...new Set(rows.map(row=>row.campus).filter(c=>coordinates[c]))].map(campus=>({campus,position:coordinates[campus],count:rows.filter(row=>row.campus===campus).length}));return <div className="national-map-card"><div className="national-map-heading"><div><div className="eyebrow">MAPA NACIONAL</div><strong>Campus con notas procesadas</strong></div><small>Ubicación orientativa · no es el centro RUCT exacto</small></div><MapContainer center={[41.8,-2.5]} zoom={6} scrollWheelZoom={false} className="national-map" aria-label="Mapa nacional de campus con ofertas procesadas"><TileLayer attribution='&copy; <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright">OpenStreetMap</a>' url="https://{s}.tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png" />{points.map(point=><CircleMarker key={point.campus} center={point.position} radius={7} pathOptions={{color:'#9b4e3e',fillColor:'#d16c52',fillOpacity:.9,weight:2}}><Tooltip direction="top"><strong>{point.campus}</strong><br/>{point.count} ofertas procesadas</Tooltip></CircleMarker>)}</MapContainer></div>}
function NationalPage({onBack}){const [rows,setRows]=useState([]);const [query,setQuery]=useState('');const [community,setCommunity]=useState('Todas las comunidades');const [score,setScore]=useState('');const [tolerance,setTolerance]=useState('0');const [sort,setSort]=useState('cutoff');const [error,setError]=useState('');useEffect(()=>{fetch('/api-port.json?ts='+Date.now()).then(r=>r.ok?r.json():{port:8787}).catch(()=>({port:8787})).then(c=>fetch(`http://127.0.0.1:${c.port||8787}/api/national-offers?limit=1000`)).then(r=>r.ok?r.json():Promise.reject(new Error('No se pudo cargar el catálogo nacional'))).then(p=>setRows(Array.isArray(p.data)?p.data:[])).catch(e=>setError(e.message))},[]);const communities=['Todas las comunidades',...new Set(rows.map(r=>r.community).filter(Boolean))];const numeric=Number(score.replace(',','.'));const filtered=rows.filter(row=>(!query||`${row.degree} ${row.university} ${row.campus||''}`.toLocaleLowerCase().includes(query.toLocaleLowerCase()))&&(community==='Todas las comunidades'||row.community===community)&&(!score||(!Number.isNaN(numeric)&&row.cutoff<=numeric+Number(tolerance)))).sort((a,b)=>sort==='name'?a.degree.localeCompare(b.degree):b.cutoff-a.cutoff);return <div className="app national-page"><header className="topbar"><button className="route-back" onClick={onBack}>← Volver al Atlas</button><div className="brand"><span className="brand-mark">A</span><span>ATLAS <i>UNIVERSITARIO</i></span></div><div className="year">ESPAÑA · 2025—26</div></header><main><div className="route-kicker">EXPLORADOR NACIONAL · DATOS PROCESADOS</div><h1 className="route-title">¿Qué puedes estudiar en España?</h1><p className="route-subtitle">Compara notas de corte oficiales de {rows.length||'…'} observaciones en tres comunidades. La cobertura se ampliará progresivamente.</p><NationalMap rows={rows}/><div className="national-controls"><label>Buscar carrera o universidad<input value={query} onChange={e=>setQuery(e.target.value)} placeholder="Informática, Zaragoza…"/></label><label>Comunidad<select value={community} onChange={e=>setCommunity(e.target.value)}>{communities.map(c=><option key={c}>{c}</option>)}</select></label><label>Tu nota<input inputMode="decimal" value={score} onChange={e=>setScore(e.target.value)} placeholder="12,40"/></label><label>Tolerancia<select value={tolerance} onChange={e=>setTolerance(e.target.value)}><option value="0">Sin tolerancia</option><option value="0.1">+0,1</option><option value="0.2">+0,2</option><option value="0.3">+0,3</option><option value="0.5">+0,5</option></select></label><button className="sort" onClick={()=>setSort(sort==='cutoff'?'name':'cutoff')}><ArrowUpDown size={15}/> {sort==='cutoff'?'Ordenar por nota':'Ordenar por nombre'}</button></div>{error?<div className="national-empty"><strong>{error}</strong><p>Comprueba que has iniciado el proyecto con `iniciar.bat`.</p></div>:<><div className="national-summary"><strong>{filtered.length}</strong> resultados · {score&&Number.isFinite(numeric)?`hasta ${fmt(numeric+Number(tolerance))} con tu tolerancia`:'usa tu nota para ver posibilidades de acceso'}</div><div className="national-table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>CARRERA</th><th>UNIVERSIDAD · CAMPUS</th><th>COMUNIDAD</th><th>NOTA</th><th>FUENTE</th></tr></thead><tbody>{filtered.map(row=><tr key={row.id}><td><strong>{row.degree}</strong></td><td>{row.university}<small>{row.campus||'Campus no publicado'}</small></td><td>{row.community}</td><td><b>{fmt(row.cutoff)}</b><small>/ 14 · {row.admissionRound==='ordinary'?'ordinaria':'extraordinaria'}</small></td><td><a href={row.sourceUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Publicación oficial <ExternalLink size={13}/></a></td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div></>}</main></div>}
function MethodologyPanel({onClose}){return <section className="methodology-panel"><div className="modal-head"><div><div className="eyebrow">METODOLOGÍA</div><h2>Cómo leer los datos</h2></div><button onClick={onClose} aria-label="Cerrar metodología"><X/></button></div><div className="methodology-content"><div className="methodology-copy"><p><strong>Nota de corte:</strong> último admitido de una oferta, grupo y convocatoria concretos. No es una nota media ni garantiza la admisión futura.</p><p><strong>Percentil:</strong> posición de la oferta dentro de las {offers.length} notas numéricas cargadas, siempre en escala 0–14. No es el percentil de Selectividad.</p><p><strong>Filtros:</strong> “Todos” exige que se cumplan universidad, rama, ciudad, tipo y nota personal seleccionados. “Cualquiera” acepta una coincidencia en cualquiera de ellos; la búsqueda de texto se mantiene como búsqueda principal. La tolerancia de nota incluye ofertas hasta ese margen y las etiqueta como posible acceso por lista de espera.</p><p><strong>Resultados:</strong> rendimiento, abandono y graduación conservan su curso y cobertura. Si el SIIU no permite atribuir un dato a una carrera concreta, mostramos el contexto universitario o “No disponible”.</p><p><strong>Empleo:</strong> una base media de cotización no es salario medio ni mediano. No se mostrará como salario.</p><p className="method-note"><Info size={15}/> Explorador activo: Comunidad de Madrid, curso 2025–2026, con fuente oficial y fila de origen conservadas. Catálogo nacional de trabajo: {nationalQuality.records} observaciones en {nationalQuality.communities.length} comunidades; todavía no se muestra como ranking porque la rama y los cupos no tienen cobertura homogénea.</p></div><div className="source-coverage"><strong>Mapa de cobertura nacional</strong><span>{admissionsSources.filter(source=>source.status==='verified').length} fuentes verificadas · {admissionsSources.filter(source=>source.status==='pending').length} pendientes</span><div>{admissionsSources.map(source=><span key={source.community} className={source.status}><i/>{source.community}{source.url&&<a href={source.url} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">fuente</a>}</span>)}</div></div></div></section>}
function StandalonePage({route,onBack,onNavigate,offers}){
  const offer=route.type==='offer'?findOfferByRoute(offers,route.value):null;
  const university=route.type==='university'?universities.find(u=>u.short.toLowerCase()===route.value||slugify(u.name)===route.value):null;
  const degree=route.type==='degree'?offers.find(o=>slugify(o.degree)===route.value)?.degree:null;
  const city=route.type==='city'?offers.find(o=>slugify(o.city)===route.value)?.city:null;
  const list=university?offers.filter(o=>o.short===university.short):degree?offers.filter(o=>o.degree===degree):city?offers.filter(o=>o.city===city):[];
  const title=offer?.degree||university?.name||degree||city||'Página no encontrada';
  const summary=(university||degree||city)&&list.length?(()=>{const cutoffs=list.map(o=>o.cutoff).filter(Number.isFinite).sort((a,b)=>a-b);return <div className="route-facts route-summary"><div><span>Ofertas</span><strong>{list.length}</strong></div><div><span>Titulaciones</span><strong>{new Set(list.map(o=>o.degree)).size}</strong></div><div><span>Nota mínima</span><strong>{fmt(cutoffs[0])}</strong></div><div><span>Nota mediana</span><strong>{fmt(cutoffs[Math.floor(cutoffs.length/2)])}</strong></div><div><span>Nota máxima</span><strong>{fmt(cutoffs[cutoffs.length-1])}</strong></div><div><span>Campus / ciudades</span><strong>{new Set(list.map(o=>o.city)).size}</strong></div></div>})():null;
  return <div className="app route-page"><header className="topbar"><button className="route-back" onClick={onBack}>← Volver al Atlas</button><div className="brand"><span className="brand-mark">A</span><span>ATLAS <i>UNIVERSITARIO</i></span></div><div className="year">MADRID · 2025—26</div></header><main><div className="route-kicker">{offer?'OFERTA CONCRETA':university?'UNIVERSIDAD PÚBLICA':degree?'TITULACIÓN':'RUTA' } · COMUNIDAD DE MADRID</div><h1 className="route-title">{title}</h1>{offer&&<p className="route-subtitle">{offer.university} · {offer.campus} · {offer.city}</p>}{university&&<p className="route-subtitle">{university.city} · seis universidades públicas de Madrid</p>}{degree&&<p className="route-subtitle">{list.length} ofertas encontradas en Madrid para esta titulación</p>}{summary}{offer?<><div className="detail-hero route-metrics"><div><span>Nota de corte</span><strong>{fmt(offer.cutoff)}</strong><small>sobre 14 · grupo 1 ordinario</small></div><div><span>Percentil en Madrid</span><strong>{percentile(offer.cutoff)}<small>º</small></strong><small>entre {offers.length} ofertas</small></div><div><span>Duración / créditos</span><strong>4 años</strong><small>240 ECTS · fuente oficial</small></div></div><div className="route-facts"><div><span>Universidad</span><strong>{offer.university}</strong></div><div><span>Campus / ciudad</span><strong>{offer.campus} · {offer.city}</strong></div><div><span>Rama</span><strong>{offer.branch}</strong></div><div><span>Tipo de oferta</span><strong>{offer.double?'Doble grado':'Grado'}</strong></div>{offer.ructDegreeCode&&<div><span>Código RUCT del título</span><strong>{offer.ructDegreeCode}</strong><a href={offer.ructSourceUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Ver ficha oficial</a></div>}{offer.ructField&&<div><span>Campo RUCT</span><strong>{offer.ructField}</strong></div>}{offer.ructCenters?.length&&<div><span>Centro RUCT</span><strong>{offer.ructCenters.map(center=>center.name).join(' · ')}</strong></div>}</div><OutcomePanel offer={offer}/></>:<div className="route-list">{list.length?list.map(o=><button key={o.id} onClick={()=>onNavigate(`/oferta/${o.id}`)}><span><strong>{o.degree}</strong><small>{o.campus} · {o.city}</small></span><b>{fmt(o.cutoff)}</b></button>):<div className="route-empty"><strong>No hemos encontrado esa oferta.</strong><p>Puede que el catálogo se haya actualizado o que el enlace use un identificador antiguo.</p><button onClick={onBack}>Volver al explorador</button></div>}</div>}<a className="source-link" href={SOURCE} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Abrir publicación oficial <ExternalLink size={14}/></a><div className="method-note"><Info size={15}/> La nota de corte orienta sobre el último admitido en un proceso concreto; no es la nota media de acceso ni garantiza la admisión futura.</div></main></div>
}

function ScoreFilterBar({branch,setBranch,university,setUniversity,city,setCity,kind,setKind,score,setScore,tolerance,setTolerance,employment,setEmployment,tuition,setTuition,mode,setMode,onApply}){
  const count=[university!=='Todas las universidades',branch!=='Todas las ramas',city!=='Todas las ciudades',kind!=='Todos los tipos',employment!=='any',tuition!=='any',score.trim()!==''].filter(Boolean).length;
  const countLabel=count===1?'1 filtro seleccionado':`${count} filtros seleccionados`;
  return <div className="offer-filters"><div><div className="eyebrow">FILTRAR OFERTAS</div><strong>Configura tu búsqueda</strong><small>{count?countLabel:'Sin filtros adicionales'}</small></div><label>Universidad<select value={university} onChange={e=>setUniversity(e.target.value)}><option>Todas las universidades</option>{universities.map(u=><option key={u.short} value={u.short}>{u.short} · {u.name.replace('Universidad ','')}</option>)}</select></label><label>Rama<select value={branch} onChange={e=>setBranch(e.target.value)}>{branchOptions.map(option=><option key={option}>{option}</option>)}</select></label><label>Ciudad<select value={city} onChange={e=>setCity(e.target.value)}>{cityOptions.map(option=><option key={option}>{option}</option>)}</select></label><label>Tu nota<input type="text" inputMode="decimal" value={score} onChange={e=>setScore(e.target.value)} placeholder="12,40"/></label><label>Tolerancia<select value={tolerance} onChange={e=>setTolerance(e.target.value)}><option value="0">Sin tolerancia</option><option value="0.1">+0,1</option><option value="0.2">+0,2</option><option value="0.3">+0,3</option><option value="0.5">+0,5</option><option value="1">+1,0</option></select></label><label>Empleo<select value={employment} onChange={e=>setEmployment(e.target.value)}><option value="any">Cualquier dato</option><option value="with-data">Con referencia laboral</option></select></label><label>Tipo<select value={kind} onChange={e=>setKind(e.target.value)}><option>Todos los tipos</option><option>Grado</option><option>Doble grado</option></select></label><label>Combinar<select value={mode} onChange={e=>setMode(e.target.value)}><option value="intersection">Todos los filtros</option><option value="union">Cualquier filtro</option></select></label><button className="apply-filters" onClick={onApply}>Aplicar {count} {count===1?'filtro':'filtros'}</button></div>;
}
class ErrorBoundary extends React.Component {
  state = { hasError: false };
  static getDerivedStateFromError() { return { hasError: true }; }
  componentDidCatch(error) { console.error('Atlas render error', error); }
  render() { return this.state.hasError ? <div className="app error-page" role="alert"><main><div className="eyebrow">ATLAS UNIVERSITARIO</div><h1>No hemos podido cargar esta vista</h1><p>El catálogo sigue guardado y puedes volver al explorador para continuar.</p><div className="error-actions"><button onClick={() => { window.history.pushState({}, '', '/'); window.location.reload(); }}>Volver al explorador</button><button onClick={() => window.location.reload()}>Reintentar</button></div></main></div> : this.props.children; }
}
function App(){
  useEffect(()=>{const closeOverlays=event=>{if(event.key==='Escape'){setView('explore');setDetail(null);setUniversityDetail(null)}};window.addEventListener('keydown',closeOverlays);return()=>window.removeEventListener('keydown',closeOverlays)},[]);
  const [query,setQuery]=useState(''); const [branch,setBranch]=useState('Todas las ramas'); const [universityFilter,setUniversityFilter]=useState('Todas las universidades'); const [city,setCity]=useState('Todas las ciudades'); const [kind,setKind]=useState('Todos los tipos'); const [filterMode,setFilterMode]=useState('intersection'); const [appliedFilters,setAppliedFilters]=useState({branch:'Todas las ramas',university:'Todas las universidades',city:'Todas las ciudades',kind:'Todos los tipos',mode:'intersection'}); const [sort,setSort]=useState('cutoff'); const [selected,setSelected]=useState([]); const [view,setView]=useState('explore'); const [score,setScore]=useState(''); const [detail,setDetail]=useState(null); const [universityDetail,setUniversityDetail]=useState(null);
  const [route,setRoute]=useState(()=>parseRoute());
  const [tolerance,setTolerance]=useState('0');
  const [appliedScore,setAppliedScore]=useState('');
  const [appliedTolerance,setAppliedTolerance]=useState('0');
  const [employmentFilter,setEmploymentFilter]=useState('any');  const [tuitionFilter,setTuitionFilter]=useState('any');
  const [appliedEmploymentFilter,setAppliedEmploymentFilter]=useState('any');  const [appliedTuitionFilter,setAppliedTuitionFilter]=useState('any');
  const [catalog,setCatalog]=useState(madridOffers);
  const offers=catalog;
  useEffect(()=>{fetch('/api-port.json?ts='+Date.now()).then(response=>response.ok?response.json():{port:8787}).catch(()=>({port:8787})).then(config=>fetch(`http://127.0.0.1:${config.port||8787}/api/offers?limit=1000`)).then(response=>response.ok?response.json():Promise.reject(new Error('API unavailable'))).then(payload=>{if(Array.isArray(payload.data)&&payload.data.length)setCatalog(payload.data)}).catch(()=>{/* El catálogo local es el fallback intencionado. */})},[]);
  useEffect(()=>{const onPop=()=>setRoute(parseRoute());window.addEventListener('popstate',onPop);return()=>window.removeEventListener('popstate',onPop)},[]);
  const navigate=path=>{window.history.pushState({},'',path);setRoute(parseRoute())};
  useEffect(()=>{
    const offer=route.type==='offer'?findOfferByRoute(offers,route.value):null;
    const university=route.type==='university'?universities.find(u=>u.short.toLowerCase()===route.value||slugify(u.name)===route.value):null;
    const degree=route.type==='degree'?offers.find(o=>slugify(o.degree)===route.value)?.degree:null;
    const city=route.type==='city'?offers.find(o=>slugify(o.city)===route.value)?.city:null;
    const title=offer?`${offer.degree} · ${offer.short} | Atlas Universitario`:university?`${university.name} | Atlas Universitario`:degree?`${degree} en Madrid | Atlas Universitario`:city?`${city} · ofertas universitarias | Atlas Universitario`:'Atlas Universitario · Madrid';
    const description=offer?`Nota de corte ${fmt(offer.cutoff)} para ${offer.degree} en ${offer.university}, curso 2025–2026.`:university?`${university.name}: ofertas, campus y notas de corte del curso 2025–2026.`:degree?`Compara ${degree} en las universidades públicas de Madrid.`:city?`Consulta las ofertas universitarias y notas de corte de ${city} en Madrid.`:'Explora carreras, universidades y notas de corte de Madrid.';
    document.title=title;
    let meta=document.querySelector('meta[name="description"]');
    if(!meta){meta=document.createElement('meta');meta.name='description';document.head.appendChild(meta)}
    meta.content=description;
    let canonical=document.querySelector('link[rel="canonical"]');
    if(!canonical){canonical=document.createElement('link');canonical.rel='canonical';document.head.appendChild(canonical)}
    canonical.href=`${window.location.origin}${window.location.pathname}`;
    let jsonLd=document.querySelector('#atlas-jsonld');
    if(!jsonLd){jsonLd=document.createElement('script');jsonLd.id='atlas-jsonld';jsonLd.type='application/ld+json';document.head.appendChild(jsonLd)}
    const listedOffers=list.slice(0,50).map((item,index)=>({'@type':'ListItem',position:index+1,name:item.degree,url:`${window.location.origin}/oferta/${item.id}`}));
    const structuredData=offer?{'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'Course','name':offer.degree,'description':description,'url':`${window.location.origin}/oferta/${offer.id}`,'provider':{'@type':'CollegeOrUniversity','name':offer.university,'address':{'@type':'PostalAddress','addressLocality':offer.city,'addressRegion':'Comunidad de Madrid','addressCountry':'ES'}}}:university?{'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'CollegeOrUniversity','name':university.name,'url':`${window.location.origin}/universidad/${university.short.toLowerCase()}`,'address':{'@type':'PostalAddress','addressLocality':university.city,'addressRegion':'Comunidad de Madrid','addressCountry':'ES'},'hasOfferCatalog':{'@type':'OfferCatalog','name':`Grados de ${university.name}`,'itemListElement':listedOffers}}:(degree||city)?{'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'ItemList','name':title,'description':description,'url':`${window.location.origin}${window.location.pathname}`,'numberOfItems':list.length,'itemListElement':listedOffers}:{'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'WebSite','name':'Atlas Universitario','url':window.location.origin,'inLanguage':'es'};
    jsonLd.textContent=JSON.stringify(structuredData);
    if(route.type==='national'){document.title='Explorador nacional de notas · Atlas Universitario';meta.content='Explora notas de corte oficiales de Madrid, Galicia y Aragón, con filtros por comunidad y tu nota de acceso.'}
    if(route.type==='universityCompare'){document.title='Comparador de universidades · Atlas Universitario';meta.content='Compara hasta cuatro universidades públicas de Madrid por oferta, notas y contexto académico SIIU.'}
  },[route,offers]);
  if(route.type==='national') return <Suspense fallback={<RouteLoading label="Cargando explorador nacional…" />}><NationalPagePaged onBack={()=>navigate('/')}/></Suspense>;
  if(route.type==='universityCompare') return <Suspense fallback={<RouteLoading label="Cargando comparador…" />}><UniversityCompare universities={universities} offers={offers} onBack={()=>navigate('/')}/></Suspense>;
  if(route.type!=='home') return <StandalonePage route={route} offers={offers} onBack={()=>navigate('/')} onNavigate={navigate}/>;
  const baseFiltered=useMemo(()=>{const normalizedQuery=query.toLowerCase();const queryMatches=o=>!query||`${o.degree} ${o.university} ${o.city}`.toLowerCase().includes(normalizedQuery);const selectors=[appliedFilters.branch!=='Todas las ramas'?o=>o.branch===appliedFilters.branch:null,appliedFilters.university!=='Todas las universidades'?o=>o.short===appliedFilters.university:null,appliedFilters.city!=='Todas las ciudades'?o=>o.city===appliedFilters.city:null,appliedFilters.kind!=='Todos los tipos'?o=>(appliedFilters.kind==='Doble grado'?o.double:!o.double):null,appliedScore!==''?o=>o.cutoff<=Number(String(appliedScore).replace(',','.'))+Number(appliedTolerance):null,appliedEmploymentFilter==='with-data'?o=>Boolean(employmentForOffer(o)):null,appliedTuitionFilter!=='any'?o=>{const annual=tuitionForOffer(o)?.annual;return appliedTuitionFilter==='no-data'?!annual:annual&&((appliedTuitionFilter==='lt1000'&&annual<1000)||(appliedTuitionFilter==='1000to1300'&&annual>=1000&&annual<1300)||(appliedTuitionFilter==='gte1300'&&annual>=1300))}:null].filter(Boolean);return offers.filter(o=>queryMatches(o)&&(selectors.length===0||(appliedFilters.mode==='union'?selectors.some(c=>c(o)):selectors.every(c=>c(o))))).sort((a,b)=>sort==='cutoff'?b.cutoff-a.cutoff:sort==='employment'?(employmentForOffer(b)?.contributionBase4??-1)-(employmentForOffer(a)?.contributionBase4??-1):a.degree.localeCompare(b.degree))},[query,appliedFilters,sort,appliedScore,appliedTolerance,appliedEmploymentFilter,appliedTuitionFilter]);
  const filtered=baseFiltered;
  const coveredUniversities=new Set(offers.map(o=>o.short).filter(Boolean)).size;
  const toggle=(o)=>setSelected(s=>s.find(x=>x.id===o.id)?s.filter(x=>x.id!==o.id):s.length<4?[...s,o]:s);
  const applyFilters=()=>{setAppliedFilters({branch,university:universityFilter,city,kind,mode:filterMode});setAppliedScore(score);setAppliedTolerance(tolerance);setAppliedEmploymentFilter(employmentFilter);setAppliedTuitionFilter(tuitionFilter)};
  return <div className="app">
    <header className="topbar"><div className="brand"><span className="brand-mark">A</span><span>ATLAS <i>UNIVERSITARIO</i></span></div><nav><button className={view==='explore'?'active':''} onClick={()=>setView('explore')}>Explorar</button><button onClick={()=>navigate('/espana')}>España</button><button onClick={()=>navigate('/comparar-universidades')}>Universidades</button><button onClick={()=>setView('compare')}>Comparar {selected.length>0&&<b>{selected.length}</b>}</button><button onClick={()=>setView('calculator')}>Calculadora PAU</button><button onClick={()=>setView('methodology')}>Metodología</button></nav><div className="year">2025—26 <ChevronDown size={15}/></div></header>
    <main><div className="top-actions">{view==='methodology'&&<MethodologyPanel onClose={()=>setView('explore')}/>}<div className="top-tools"><label>Tipo<select value={kind} onChange={e=>setKind(e.target.value)}><option>Todos los tipos</option><option>Grado</option><option>Doble grado</option></select></label><button className="sort" onClick={()=>downloadCsv(filtered)}><Download size={15}/> Descargar resultados CSV</button><button className="sort" onClick={()=>setView('methodology')}><Info size={15}/> Metodología</button></div></div>
      <section className="hero"><div className="eyebrow">PRIMERA EDICIÓN · COMUNIDAD DE MADRID</div><h1>El sistema universitario,<br/><em>a simple vista.</em></h1><p>Explora dónde estudiar, compara notas de corte y descubre cómo se distribuye la oferta universitaria.</p><div className="search"><Search size={21}/><input value={query} onChange={e=>setQuery(e.target.value)} placeholder="Busca una carrera, universidad o ciudad…"/><span>⌘ K</span></div><div className="quick"><span>Prueba con</span><button onClick={()=>setQuery('informática')}>Ingeniería Informática</button><button onClick={()=>setQuery('Madrid')}>Madrid</button><button onClick={()=>setQuery('software')}>Software</button></div></section>
      <section className="stats"><div><strong>6</strong><span>universidades públicas</span></div><div><strong>{offers.length}</strong><span>ofertas en esta vista</span></div><div><strong>5—14</strong><span>escala de admisión</span></div><div className="stat-note"><Info size={15}/><span>Datos de corte ordinario<br/>del curso 2025–2026</span></div></section>
      <section className="workspace"><div className="section-head"><div><div className="eyebrow">MAPA DE OFERTA</div><h2>Madrid universitario</h2></div><div className="controls"><select value={universityFilter} onChange={e=>setUniversityFilter(e.target.value)}><option>Todas las universidades</option>{universities.map(u=><option key={u.short} value={u.short}>{u.short} · {u.name.replace('Universidad ','')}</option>)}</select><select value={branch} onChange={e=>setBranch(e.target.value)}>{branchOptions.map(option=><option key={option}>{option}</option>)}</select><select value={city} onChange={e=>setCity(e.target.value)}>{cityOptions.map(option=><option key={option}>{option}</option>)}</select><select value={filterMode} onChange={e=>setFilterMode(e.target.value)} aria-label="Modo de combinación de filtros"><option value="intersection">Todos los filtros</option><option value="union">Cualquier filtro</option></select><button className="filter"><SlidersHorizontal size={16}/> Filtros</button></div></div>
        <div className="map-layout"><div className="map-card"><div className="map-label"><MapPin size={16}/> 6 universidades <small>· {offers.length} ofertas verificadas + catálogo inicial</small></div><MapContainer center={[40.43,-3.66]} zoom={10} scrollWheelZoom={false} className="leaflet-map" aria-label="Mapa de universidades de la Comunidad de Madrid"><TileLayer attribution='&copy; <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright">OpenStreetMap</a>' url="https://{s}.tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png" />{universities.map(u=><CircleMarker key={u.short} center={u.position} radius={7} pathOptions={{color:u.color,fillColor:u.color,fillOpacity:.9,weight:2}} eventHandlers={{click:()=>setQuery(u.short)}}><Tooltip direction="top"><strong>{u.short}</strong><br/>{u.name}<br/><span>{u.city}</span></Tooltip></CircleMarker>)}</MapContainer><div className="map-legend"><span className="legend-title">COLOR = UNIVERSIDAD</span>{universities.map(u=><span key={u.short}><i className="dot" style={{background:u.color}}/>{u.short}</span>)}<span><i className="ring"/> OpenStreetMap</span></div></div>
          <aside className="insight"><div className="eyebrow">EN ESTA VISTA</div><h3>Ingeniería Informática</h3><p className="muted">La misma carrera cambia de contexto según el campus.</p><div className="mini-bars">{filtered.filter(x=>x.degree==='Ingeniería Informática').slice(0,5).map(o=><div className="bar-row" key={o.id}><span>{o.short} · {o.campus}</span><div><i style={{width:`${o.cutoff/14*100}%`}}/><b>{fmt(o.cutoff)}</b></div></div>)}</div><button className="text-link" onClick={()=>setQuery('Ingeniería Informática')}>Ver todas las ofertas <span>↗</span></button></aside></div>
      </section>
      <section className="university-section"><div className="section-head"><div><div className="eyebrow">UNIVERSIDADES PÚBLICAS</div><h2>Seis puertas de entrada</h2><p className="muted">Explora la oferta cargada por universidad.</p></div></div><div className="university-grid">{universities.map(u=>{const list=offers.filter(o=>o.short===u.short);const median=[...list].sort((a,b)=>a.cutoff-b.cutoff)[Math.floor(list.length/2)]?.cutoff;return <button className="university-card" key={u.short} onClick={()=>navigate(`/universidad/${u.short.toLowerCase()}`)}><span className="uni-dot" style={{background:u.color}}>{u.short}</span><strong>{u.name.replace('Universidad ','')}</strong><span>{u.city} · {list.length} ofertas</span><small>Nota mediana <b>{median?fmt(median):'—'}</b></small><span className="card-arrow">↗</span></button>})}</div></section>
      <ScoreFilterBar branch={branch} setBranch={setBranch} university={universityFilter} setUniversity={setUniversityFilter} city={city} setCity={setCity} kind={kind} setKind={setKind} score={score} setScore={setScore} tolerance={tolerance} setTolerance={setTolerance} employment={employmentFilter} setEmployment={setEmploymentFilter} tuition={tuitionFilter} setTuition={setTuitionFilter} mode={filterMode} setMode={setFilterMode} onApply={applyFilters}/><section className="table-section"><div className="section-head"><div><div className="eyebrow">EXPLORADOR DE NOTAS</div><h2>Ofertas universitarias</h2><p className="muted">{filtered.length} resultados · nota final de corte · admisión ordinaria · grupo 1</p></div><button className="sort" onClick={()=>setSort(sort==='cutoff'?'employment':sort==='employment'?'name':'cutoff')}><ArrowUpDown size={15}/> {sort==='cutoff'?'Ordenar por nota':sort==='employment'?'Ordenar por base laboral':'Ordenar por nombre'}</button></div><div className="coverage-note"><Info size={15}/><span><strong>Cobertura verificable:</strong> {offers.length} ofertas en {coveredUniversities} universidades públicas · Madrid · curso 2025–2026 · notas de corte oficiales. Las métricas académicas y laborales por titulación solo aparecen cuando existe un cruce compatible.</span></div><div className="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>CARRERA / CAMPUS</th><th>UNIVERSIDAD</th><th>NOTA DE CORTE</th><th>PERCENTIL</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody>{filtered.map(o=><tr key={o.id} className={selected.some(s=>s.id===o.id)?'selected':''}><td><button className="degree-link" onClick={()=>navigate(`/oferta/${o.id}`)}>{o.degree}</button><small>{o.campus} · {o.city}</small></td><td><strong className="uni-code">{o.short}</strong><span>{o.university.replace('Universidad ','')}</span></td><td><strong className="cutoff">{fmt(o.cutoff)}</strong><span className="scale">/ 14</span>{appliedScore!==''&&<small className={o.cutoff<=Number(String(appliedScore).replace(',','.'))?'fit-direct':'fit-waitlist'}>{o.cutoff<=Number(String(appliedScore).replace(',','.'))?'Dentro de tu nota':'Posible por lista de espera'}</small>}</td><td><div className="percent"><i style={{width:`${percentile(o.cutoff)}%`}}/><span>{percentile(o.cutoff)}<small>º</small></span></div></td><td><button className={`compare-btn ${selected.some(s=>s.id===o.id)?'chosen':''}`} onClick={()=>toggle(o)}>{selected.some(s=>s.id===o.id)?<><Check size={14}/> En comparador</>:<><Plus size={14}/> Comparar</>}</button></td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div></section>
      <section className="score-section"><div><div className="eyebrow">TU NOTA EN ESPAÑA</div><h2>¿Qué puedes estudiar?</h2><p>Introduce una nota para situarla frente a las ofertas que tenemos cargadas.</p></div><div className="score-input"><input value={score} onChange={e=>setScore(e.target.value)} placeholder="12,40"/><span>/ 14</span>{score&&<div className="score-result"><strong>{Math.max(0,Math.min(100,percentile(Number(score.replace(',','.')))))}<small>º percentil</small></strong><span>entre las ofertas comparables<br/><b>{filtered.filter(o=>o.cutoff<=Number(score.replace(',','.'))).length} opciones</b> por debajo de tu nota</span></div>}</div></section>
    </main>
    {selected.length>0&&<div className="compare-dock"><div><b>{selected.length}</b> ofertas seleccionadas <span>· hasta 4</span></div><div className="dock-actions"><button onClick={()=>setSelected([])}><X size={15}/> Limpiar</button><button className="primary" onClick={()=>setView('compare')}>Comparar ahora ↗</button></div></div>}
    {view==='calculator'&&<Suspense fallback={<RouteLoading label="Cargando calculadora…" />}><SelectivityCalculator onClose={()=>setView('explore')}/></Suspense>}
    <footer><div className="brand"><span className="brand-mark">A</span><span>ATLAS <i>UNIVERSITARIO</i></span></div><span>Datos verificables. Contexto para decidir.</span><a href={SOURCE} target="_blank">Ver fuente oficial <ExternalLink size={13}/></a></footer>
    {view==='compare'&&<div className="modal-backdrop" onClick={()=>setView('explore')}><div className="compare-modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="compare-title" onClick={e=>e.stopPropagation()}><div className="modal-head"><div><div className="eyebrow">COMPARADOR</div><h2 id="compare-title">{selected.length?`${selected.length} ofertas seleccionadas`:'Selecciona ofertas desde el explorador'}</h2></div><button onClick={()=>setView('explore')} aria-label="Cerrar comparador"><X/></button></div>{selected.length?<div className="compare-grid"><div className="metric-label"><span>Nota de corte</span><span>Percentil en esta vista</span><span>Campus</span><span>Base laboral</span><span>Afiliación 4 años</span><span>Indefinido 4 años</span><span>Fuente</span></div>{selected.map(o=><div className="compare-col" key={o.id}><b>{o.short}</b><h3>{o.degree}</h3><strong>{fmt(o.cutoff)}</strong><span>{percentile(o.cutoff)}º</span><span>{o.campus}</span><span>{employmentForOffer(o)?fmtEuro(employmentForOffer(o).contributionBase4):'—'}</span><span>{fmtPercent(employmentForOffer(o)?.affiliation4)}</span><span>{fmtPercent(employmentForOffer(o)?.indefinite4)}</span><small>{o.source}</small></div>)}</div>:<div className="empty-compare"><BarChart3 size={34}/><p>Marca “Comparar” en dos o más filas para verlas aquí.</p></div>}<div className="method-note"><Info size={15}/> El percentil se calcula sobre las {offers.length} ofertas cargadas en esta edición, con nota numérica válida y escala 14. No equivale al percentil de alumnos de Selectividad.</div></div></div>}
    {detail&&<div className="modal-backdrop" onClick={()=>setDetail(null)}><div className="detail-modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="detail-title" onClick={e=>e.stopPropagation()}><div className="modal-head"><div><div className="eyebrow">FICHA DE OFERTA · 2025—26</div><h2 id="detail-title">{detail.degree}</h2><p className="muted">{detail.university} · {detail.campus}</p></div><button onClick={()=>setDetail(null)} aria-label="Cerrar detalle de oferta"><X/></button></div><div className="detail-hero"><div><span>Nota de corte</span><strong>{fmt(detail.cutoff)}</strong><small>sobre 14 · grupo 1 ordinario</small></div><div><span>Percentil en Madrid</span><strong>{percentile(detail.cutoff)}<small>º</small></strong><small>entre {offers.length} ofertas cargadas</small></div><div><span>Duración / créditos</span><strong>4 años</strong><small>240 ECTS · fuente oficial</small></div></div><div className="detail-grid"><div><span>Universidad</span><strong>{detail.university}</strong></div><div><span>Campus / ciudad</span><strong>{detail.campus} · {detail.city}</strong></div><div><span>Rama</span><strong>{detail.branch}</strong></div><div><span>Tipo de oferta</span><strong>{detail.double?'Doble grado':'Grado'}</strong></div></div><OutcomePanel offer={detail}/><a className="source-link" href={SOURCE} target="_blank">Abrir publicación oficial <ExternalLink size={14}/></a><div className="method-note"><Info size={15}/> La nota de corte orienta sobre el último admitido en un proceso concreto; no es la nota media de acceso ni garantiza la admisión futura.</div></div></div>}
    {universityDetail&&<div className="modal-backdrop" onClick={()=>setUniversityDetail(null)}><div className="detail-modal university-detail-modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="university-detail-title" onClick={e=>e.stopPropagation()}><div className="modal-head"><div><div className="eyebrow">UNIVERSIDAD PÚBLICA · MADRID</div><h2 id="university-detail-title">{universityDetail.name}</h2><p className="muted">{universityDetail.city} · catálogo de ofertas 2025—26</p></div><button onClick={()=>setUniversityDetail(null)} aria-label="Cerrar detalle de universidad"><X/></button></div><div className="university-summary"><span className="uni-dot large" style={{background:universityDetail.color}}>{universityDetail.short}</span><div><strong>{offers.filter(o=>o.short===universityDetail.short).length}</strong><span>ofertas cargadas</span></div><div><strong>{new Set(offers.filter(o=>o.short===universityDetail.short).map(o=>o.degree)).size}</strong><span>titulaciones</span></div></div><div className="university-offer-list">{offers.filter(o=>o.short===universityDetail.short).map(o=><button key={o.id} onClick={()=>{setUniversityDetail(null);setDetail(o)}}><span>{o.degree}<small>{o.campus}</small></span><strong>{fmt(o.cutoff)}</strong></button>)}</div><a className="source-link" href={SOURCE} target="_blank">Abrir publicación oficial <ExternalLink size={14}/></a></div></div>}
  </div>
}
createRoot(document.getElementById('root')).render(<ErrorBoundary><App/></ErrorBoundary>);
